  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">OBSE ExB projekt 2019: OSCE ExB project 2019: Workshop - Podpora inkulz&#xed;vnych pr&#xed;stupov k budovaniu mieru na ju&#x17e;nom Kaukaze</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OSCE ExB project 2019: Workshop - Promoting inclusive approaches to peace-building in the South Caucasus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Three days workshop for young people from Armenia, Azerbaijan and Georgia. Focus is on improvement of the mediating skills in the field of conflict prevention in the South Caucasus with the special attention on the gender equality, using the example of the actual peac-building process in Georgia.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Trojd&#x148;ov&#xfd; workshop pre mlad&#xfd;ch &#x13e;ud&#xed; z Arm&#xe9;nska, Azerbajd&#x17e;anu a Gruz&#xed;nska. D&#xf4;raz sa kladie na zlep&#x161;enie sprostredkovate&#x13e;sk&#xfd;ch schopnost&#xed; v oblasti predch&#xe1;dzania konfliktom na ju&#x17e;nom Kaukaze s osobitn&#xfd;m d&#xf4;razom na rodov&#xfa; rovnos&#x165;, s vyu&#x17e;it&#xed;m pr&#xed;kladu mierotvorn&#xe9;ho procesu v Gruz&#xed;nsku.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
